          "shortType": "function",
          "defaultValue": null,
          "description": "Proposes a formatted output value. Controlled fields display it after parent acceptance. Called only when the proposal differs from the value the parent holds: `value`, compared exactly, or the output an uncontrolled field already shows. So deleting a separator, which keeps the number, calls nothing, while a parent that stores another form of the number, such as national digits, hears every proposal. Also called once as hydration commits, with a number typed or autofilled before the client scripts attached, under the same rule; a controlled parent accepts or rejects it like any other proposal.",
